---
/** Strengths and growth edges, side by side. */
---
<div class="guide-edges"><slot /></div>

<style>
  .guide-edges { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .guide-edges { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 14px; } }
</style>
